roval authority under CREDIT-POLICY-2026, which reserves credit approvals to Finance roles (Accounts Receivable Specialist, Finance Manager, Director of Finance).\n\n---\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"REJECT_OR_ESCALATE\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"CR-9205\",\n    \"customer\": \"BlueRiver Logistics (C-1002)\",\n    \"current_limit\": 100000,\n    \"requested_limit\": 200000,\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"Michael Torres (michael.torres@northstar.example)\",\n    \"basis\": \"standard\"\n  },\n  \"eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"ineligible\",\n    \"maximum_limit\": 250000,\n    \"basis\": \"Customer fails payment history requirement: invoice INV-62147 was paid 52 days after due date, exceeding CREDIT-POLICY-2026 maximum of 30 days\",\n    \"late_invoices\": [\n      {\n        \"invoice_id\": \"INV-62147\",\n        \"due_date\": \"2026-05-30\",\n        \"paid_date\": \"2026-07-21\",\n        \"days_late\": 52\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"CREDIT-POLICY-2026 (2026-01-01 to 2026-12-31)\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": null,\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"Finance Manager\",\n    \"approvers\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Priya Shah\",\n        \"role\": \"Finance Manager\",\n        \"kind\": \"approval\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"CREDIT-POLICY-2026 effective on request date\",\n    \"CREDIT-POLICY-2026 §5: payment history requirement—no invoice due in prior 12 months may be paid more than 30 days after its due date\",\n    \"INV-62147: due 2026-05-30, paid 2026-07-21 (52 days late)\",\n    \"Account tier per CRM: Standard\",\n    \"Maximum limit for Standard accounts per policy: $250,000\",\n    \"Requested limit of $200,000 is within maximum but customer is ineligible on payment history grounds\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": []\n}\n```\n\n**Decision: The request cannot be approved. The customer does not meet the payment history eligibility requirement under CREDIT-POLICY-2026 due to late payment of INV-62147. This is an eligibility issue that cannot be resolved by escalation to a higher approver.**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5444,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5444},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8c109004-5fd1-45cc-a5e8-531640c43ffe","uuid":"e1c3c449-9d5c-4efe-9533-01c51be22198","timestamp":"2026-10-08T11:06:12.699Z","request_id":"req_011CfpfH9WdnHfH1WmUgaKq6"}
